{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W1-EIP8070-INV-004-INTERNAL", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W1-EIP8070-INV-004-INTERNAL", "property_id": "PROP-W1-EIP8070-INV-004", "graph_element_under_test": "ACTION-CHECK-BLOB-AVAILABILITY", "title": "Falsify blob inclusion policy correctness for conservative/optimistic/proactive modes", "reachability": {"classification": "internal-only", "entry_points": ["Internal API"], "attacker_controlled": false, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Logic Error", "risk_category": "Consensus Logic", "severity_hint": "HIGH", "detection_procedure": "1. Set up a proposer node with each blob inclusion policy (conservative, optimistic, proactive). 2. For conservative: provide a blob that has full local data but has NOT been sampled. Verify it IS included. Provide a blob with only sampling confirmation. Verify it is NOT included. 3. For optimistic: provide a blob that passed sampling. Verify it IS included. Provide a blob that has NOT been sampled. Verify it is NOT included. 4. For proactive: provide a blob that passed sampling previously. Verify re-sampling occurs before inclusion. 5. Verify that no policy includes blobs with zero availability evidence.", "executable_checks": ["Conservative mode: verify only full-local-data blobs are included", "Optimistic mode: verify only sampled blobs are included", "Proactive mode: verify re-sampling occurs before proposal"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W1-EIP8070-INV-004. Invariant falsification. Including unavailable blobs causes DA verification failure network-wide."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W1-EIP8070-INV-004", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP8070-CONSENSUS", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_fdbbaecb83dd8fe9bab44d1328fa6e2f3713d5af.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP8070-CONSENSUS", "aspect": "consensus", "title": "EIP-8070: Block Builder Blob Inclusion Policies", "description": "Models the three configurable policies