{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-INV-001-INTERNAL", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-INV-001-INTERNAL", "property_id": "PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-INV-001", "graph_element_under_test": "ACTION-COMPARE-FEES", "title": "Falsify blob base fee reserve price floor enforcement", "reachability": {"classification": "internal-only", "entry_points": ["Internal API"], "attacker_controlled": false, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Consensus Divergence", "risk_category": "State Transition", "severity_hint": "HIGH", "detection_procedure": "1. Construct a block header sequence where the natural blob base fee (from EIP-4844 mechanism) drops below BLOB_BASE_COST * base_fee_per_gas / GAS_PER_BLOB. 2. Verify the reserve pricing mode activates (excess_blob_gas computation changes). 3. Test boundary: blob_base_fee exactly equals the reserve price. 4. Verify the comparison uses >= or > correctly per spec. 5. Compute excess_blob_gas under both pricing modes and verify the correct mode is selected. 6. Cross-check with at least two EL clients.", "executable_checks": ["Construct block where blob fee < reserve price, verify reserve mode activates", "Test exact boundary where blob fee == reserve price", "Compare excess_blob_gas computation across two EL clients"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-INV-001. Invariant falsification. Wrong pricing mode produces different excess_blob_gas, causing consensus split."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-INV-001", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRICE", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_c3ce7ae8484274a9b81bd1c5073ce548c23817ee.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRICE", "aspect": "gas_economics", "title": "EIP-7918: Blob Base Fee Reserve Price Mechanism", "description": "Models the reserve price floor that prevents blob base fee from falling below a ratio of execution costs", "nodes"