{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-FULU-EPOCH-PROC-INV-002-INTERNAL", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-FULU-EPOCH-PROC-INV-002-INTERNAL", "property_id": "PROP-W3-FULU-EPOCH-PROC-INV-002", "graph_element_under_test": "EDGE-SYNC-TO-LOOKAHEAD", "title": "Falsify proposer lookahead ordering after all other epoch processing steps", "reachability": {"classification": "internal-only", "entry_points": ["Internal API"], "attacker_controlled": false, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Ordering Violation", "risk_category": "Consensus Logic", "severity_hint": "HIGH", "detection_procedure": "1. Inspect the process_epoch function in each CL client. 2. Verify process_proposer_lookahead (or equivalent) is called AFTER: (a) process_justification_and_finalization, (b) process_rewards_and_penalties, (c) process_slashings, (d) process_sync_committee_updates. 3. Construct a test case where rewards/slashings change the active validator set. 4. Compute the lookahead with correct ordering vs incorrect ordering (before rewards). 5. Verify the results differ, confirming ordering matters. 6. Check all CL clients for consistent ordering.", "executable_checks": ["Audit process_epoch call order in each CL client", "Construct state where rewards change active set, verify lookahead depends on order", "Compare lookahead results with correct vs incorrect ordering"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W3-FULU-EPOCH-PROC-INV-002. Invariant falsification. Wrong ordering produces different proposer assignments on all buggy nodes."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W3-FULU-EPOCH-PROC-INV-002", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-FULU-EPOCH-PROCESSING", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_a66536936c8e_1770079940_1.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-FULU-EPOCH-PROCESSING", "aspect": "state_transition", "title": "Fulu: Epoch State Transition with Proposer Lookahead", "description": "Models the modified epoch processing pipeline that now includes proposer lookahead computation as a final step", "nodes": [{"id": "STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-START", "label": "Epoch Processing Initiated", "type": "State", "description": "The beacon state has reached an epoch boundary and epoch processing begins"}, {"id": "ACTION-PROCESS-JUSTIFICATION-FINALIZATION", "label": "Process Justification and Finalization", "type": "Action", "description": "Update justification bits and finality checkpoints based on attestation participation", "precondition": ["STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-START"], "postcondition": []}, {"id": "ACTION-PROCESS-REWARDS-PENALTIES", "label": "Process Rewards and Penalties", "type": "Action", "description": "Calculate and apply validator rewards and penalties for the epoch", "precondition": [], "postcondition": []}, {"id": "ACTION-PROCESS-SYNC-COMMITTEE-UPDATES", "label": "Process Sync Committee Updates", "type": "Action", "description": "Rotate sync committees if at a sync committee period boundary", "precondition": [], "postcondition": []}, {"id": "ACTION-PROCESS-PROPOSER-LOOKAHEAD-EPOCH", "label": "Process Proposer Lookahead (New in Fulu)", "type": "Action", "description": "Shift the lookahead window: remove earliest epoch proposers, compute and append proposers for current_epoch + MIN_SEED_LOOKAHEAD + 1", "precondition": [], "postcondition": ["STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-COMPLETE"]}, {"id": "STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-COMPLETE", "label": "Epoch Processing Complete", "type": "State", "description": "All epoch processing steps including proposer lookahead have completed, state is updated for next epoch"}], "edges": [{"id": "EDGE-START-JUSTIFICATION", "source": "STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-START", "target": "ACTION-PROCESS-JUSTIFICATION-FINALIZATION", "label": "Begin epoch processing pipeline", "data_involved": ["attestation", "epoch", "state"]}, {"id": "EDGE-JUSTIFICATION-TO-REWARDS", "source": "ACTION-PROCESS-JUSTIFICATION-FINALIZATION", "target": "ACTION-PROCESS-REWARDS-PENALTIES", "label": "Continue to rewards/penalties", "data_involved": ["attestation", "validator", "epoch"]}, {"id": "EDGE-REWARDS-TO-SYNC", "source": "ACTION-PROCESS-REWARDS-PENALTIES", "target": "ACTION-PROCESS-SYNC-COMMITTEE-UPDATES", "label": "Continue to sync committee updates", "data_involved": ["validator", "committee", "epoch"]}, {"id": "EDGE-SYNC-TO-LOOKAHEAD", "source": "ACTION-PROCESS-SYNC-COMMITTEE-UPDATES", "target": "ACTION-PROCESS-PROPOSER-LOOKAHEAD-EPOCH", "label": "Continue to proposer lookahead (added in Fulu)", "data_involved": ["committee", "epoch"]}, {"id": "EDGE-LOOKAHEAD-TO-COMPLETE", "source": "ACTION-PROCESS-PROPOSER-LOOKAHEAD-EPOCH", "target": "STATE-EPOCH-PROCESSING-COMPLETE", "label": "Epoch processing finalized", "data_involved": ["epoch", "finalized_checkpoint", "state"]}], "external_entities": []}}
{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRE-003-INTERNAL", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRE-003-INTERNAL", "property_id": "PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRE-003", "graph_element_under_test": "STATE-PARENT-BLOCK-DATA", "title": "Falsify correct parent block data retrieval for reserve price computation", "reachability": {"classification": "internal-only", "entry_points": ["Internal API"], "attacker_controlled": false, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Data Integrity", "risk_category": "State Transition", "severity_hint": "HIGH", "detection_procedure": "1. During block validation, verify the parent block's base_fee_per_gas, excess_blob_gas, and blob_gas_used are read from the correct parent (by parent_hash). 2. Test with a reorg scenario: ensure the correct parent is used after chain reorganization. 3. Verify no caching issues: if the parent was previously read for a different fork, ensure fresh data is used. 4. Edge case: genesis block as parent (no excess_blob_gas). 5. Edge case: first block after Fulu fork (parent is last Electra block).", "executable_checks": ["Verify parent data matches parent_hash, not just previous block number", "Test after reorg: verify correct parent data is used", "Test first Fulu block reading Electra parent data"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRE-003. Pre-condition falsification. Wrong parent data produces incorrect fee calculations for all subsequent blocks."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W3-EIP7918-RESERVE-PRE-003", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP7918-EXCESS-GAS-CALC", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_c3ce7ae8484274a9b81bd1c5073ce548c23817ee.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-EIP7918-EXCESS-GAS-CALC", "aspect": "state_transition", "title": "EIP-7918: Excess Blob Gas Calculation with Reserve Mode", "description": "Models the modified calc_excess_blob_gas function with reserve price conditional logic", "nodes": [{"id": "STATE-PARENT-BLOCK-DATA", "label": "Parent Block Data Retrieved", "type": "State", "description": "Parent block's excess_blob_gas, blob_gas_used, and base_fee_per_gas read"}, {"id": "ACTION-CHECK-RESERVE-CONDITION", "label": "Check Reserve Price Condition", "type": "Action", "description": "Evaluate: BLOB_BASE_COST * parent.base_fee > GAS_PER_BLOB * blob_base_fee"}, {"id": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-TRUE", "label": "Reserve Condition True", "type": "State", "description": "Execution costs dominate - reserve mode applies"}, {"id": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-FALSE", "label": "Reserve Condition False", "type": "State", "description": "Blob fees sufficient - normal mode applies"}, {"id": "ACTION-CALC-RESERVE-EXCESS", "label": "Calculate Excess (Reserve Mode)", "type": "Action", "description": "excess += blob_gas_used * (max - target) / max"}, {"id": "ACTION-CALC-NORMAL-EXCESS", "label": "Calculate Excess (Normal Mode)", "type": "Action", "description": "excess += blob_gas_used - target_blob_gas"}, {"id": "STATE-EXCESS-BLOB-GAS-COMPUTED", "label": "Excess Blob Gas Computed", "type": "State", "description": "New excess_blob_gas value determined for current block"}], "edges": [{"id": "EDGE-READ-PARENT", "source": "STATE-PARENT-BLOCK-DATA", "target": "ACTION-CHECK-RESERVE-CONDITION", "label": "Use parent data for calculation"}, {"id": "EDGE-RESERVE-TRUE", "source": "ACTION-CHECK-RESERVE-CONDITION", "target": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-TRUE", "label": "Reserve condition met"}, {"id": "EDGE-RESERVE-FALSE", "source": "ACTION-CHECK-RESERVE-CONDITION", "target": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-FALSE", "label": "Reserve condition not met"}, {"id": "EDGE-APPLY-RESERVE-CALC", "source": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-TRUE", "target": "ACTION-CALC-RESERVE-EXCESS", "label": "Apply reserve mode formula"}, {"id": "EDGE-APPLY-NORMAL-CALC", "source": "STATE-RESERVE-CONDITION-FALSE", "target": "ACTION-CALC-NORMAL-EXCESS", "label": "Apply normal formula"}, {"id": "EDGE-RESERVE-RESULT", "source": "A