{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W7-PCS-ENCODE-POSTCOND-001-INTERNAL", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W7-PCS-ENCODE-POSTCOND-001-INTERNAL", "property_id": "PROP-W7-PCS-ENCODE-POSTCOND-001", "graph_element_under_test": "ACTION-BLOB-TO-POLYNOMIAL", "title": "Falsify blob_to_polynomial output dimension (FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_BLOB evaluation points)", "reachability": {"classification": "internal-only", "entry_points": ["Internal API"], "attacker_controlled": false, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Dimension Mismatch", "risk_category": "Data Availability Sampling (PeerDAS)", "severity_hint": "MEDIUM", "detection_procedure": "1. Call blob_to_polynomial with a valid blob (FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_BLOB * 32 bytes). 2. Verify the output polynomial has exactly FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_BLOB evaluation points. 3. Test with edge-case blobs: (a) all zeros, (b) all 0xFF (but valid field elements), (c) alternating pattern. 4. Verify the polynomial degree is at most FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_BLOB - 1. 5. Cross-check: compute cells from the polynomial and verify CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB cells are produced.", "executable_checks": ["Verify blob_to_polynomial output length == FIELD_ELEMENTS_PER_BLOB", "Test with all-zero blob", "Verify cell generation produces exactly CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB cells"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W7-PCS-ENCODE-POSTCOND-001. Post-condition falsification. Incorrect polynomial dimensions would produce invalid cells, causing DA failures."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W7-PCS-ENCODE-POSTCOND-001", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-PCS-ENCODING-LIFECYCLE", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_b9c308f06c06b2d7090db74d932d2555bce8e637_1770079940_1.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-PCS-ENCODING-LIFECYCLE", "aspect": "transaction_lifecycle", "title": "Blob Encoding and Cell Production Lifecycle", "description": "Models the full pipeline from raw blob data through polynomial conversion, Reed-Solomon extension, and cell/pr