{"check_id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W7-PCS-SECBND-PRECOND-002-BOUNDARY", "checklist_item": {"id": "CHECK-W5-PROP-W7-PCS-SECBND-PRECOND-002-BOUNDARY", "property_id": "PROP-W7-PCS-SECBND-PRECOND-002", "graph_element_under_test": "ACTION-VALIDATE-INDEX-BOUNDS", "title": "Verify Trust Boundary Integrity for cell_index bounds validation from untrusted peers", "reachability": {"classification": "external-reachable", "entry_points": ["P2P"], "attacker_controlled": true, "bug_bounty_scope": "in-scope"}, "bug_class": "Out-of-Bounds Access", "risk_category": "Data Availability Sampling (PeerDAS)", "severity_hint": "HIGH", "detection_procedure": "1. Send a batch verification request containing cell_index = CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB (one past valid range). 2. Send cell_index = 2^64 - 1. 3. Verify each is rejected before any root-of-unity lookup or array access. 4. Verify valid cell_index = CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB - 1 is accepted. 5. Monitor for panics, segfaults, or index-out-of-bounds exceptions. 6. Check verify_cell_kzg_proof_batch for bounds checking on the cell_indices array.", "executable_checks": ["Send cell_index = CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB, verify rejection", "Send cell_index = MAX_UINT64, verify no crash", "Verify cell_index = CELLS_PER_EXT_BLOB - 1 is accepted"], "notes": "Source: PROP-W7-PCS-SECBND-PRECOND-002. Boundary property. Trust boundary: untrusted P2P peer provides cell_indices. Out-of-bounds access in root-of-unity lookups could crash or corrupt the node."}, "checklist_file": "outputs/02_CHECKLIST_PARTIAL_W5_1770089239_1.json", "property_id": "PROP-W7-PCS-SECBND-PRECOND-002", "subgraph_id": "SUBGRAPH-PCS-SECURITY-BOUNDARY", "subgraph_file": "outputs/01b_SUBGRAPHS/spec_b9c308f06c06b2d7090db74d932d2555bce8e637_1770079940_1.json", "subgraph": {"id": "SUBGRAPH-PCS-SECURITY-BOUNDARY", "aspect": "security_boundary", "title": "Trust Boundaries in Cell Processing", "description": "Models the trust boundaries where untrusted external data (cells, proofs, commitments) enters the cryptographic v